// MCP servers for VS Code, scoped to this workspace.
//
// This file is JSONC — comments are allowed here. The sibling `.mcp.json` at the
// repo root is strict JSON and is what Copilot CLI and the Copilot app read.
//
// The demo's servers (microsoft-learn, github) live in `.mcp.json`, which the
// Copilot harness reads directly, in VS Code too. This file only keeps the
// `${input:}` secrets pattern below, for the Local harness: the Copilot harness
// does not receive servers that need an input prompt.
